## Blynk IoT Virtual Datastream Configuration

Configure your online Blynk Dashboard or Mobile Application with these matching Datastreams to process incoming telemetric data packs correctly:

- Virtual Pin V0
  - Data Type: Integer
  - Purpose: Tracks Live Ambient Light Levels (LDR Value)
  - Recommended Widget: Value Display, Gauge, or SuperChart

- Virtual Pin V1
  - Data Type: Integer (0 or 1)
  - Purpose: Tracks Presence Detection State (0 for Safe, 1 for Motion Triggered)
  - Recommended Widget: LED Indicator Widget or Binary State Label

- Virtual Pin V2
  - Data Type: String
  - Purpose: Displays Real-time Security System Status Overviews (Secured Day/Night or Critical Intrusion Alerts)
  - Recommended Widget: Text Input / Label Display Panel
